Scope: internal/services/transfers/transfers.go, transfers_test.go (S2.2.files).
All mutation happened in scratch copies outside the repo
(/tmp/.../scratchpad/s2check/{budget2-scratch,budget2-old}); the repo itself
was only read.

1. Merge-fidelity claim (report.md RESOLUTION line).
   `diff -u /tmp/swarm-worktrees/budget2/S2/wt-primary/.../transfers.go
